"Burns <link=\"PETROLEUM\">Petroleum</link> to propel rockets for mid-range space exploration.\n"
"\n"
"Petroleum Engines have generous height restrictions, ideal for hauling many modules.\n"
"\n"
"The engine must be built first before more rocket modules can be added."
msgstr ""

