"In its default orientation, the hammer strikes the building to the left when it receives a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b>.\n"
"\n"
"Each building has a unique sound when struck by the hammer.\n"
"\n"
"The hammer does no damage when it strikes."
msgstr ""

