"Produces <link=\"POWERSTATIONTOOLS\">Microchip</link> to increase the <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> output of generators.\n"
"\n"
"Assigned Duplicants must possess the <link=\"TECHNICALS2\">Tune Up</link> trait."
