msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.PRESSURESWITCHGAS.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Automatically turns <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> on or off using ambient <link=\"PRESSURE\">Gas Pressure</link> .\n"
"\n"
"Does not affect circuitry preceding the switch."
