"STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERMATERIALREFINERY.HARDPLASTIC_RECIPE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Plastium is a highly heat-resistant, plastic-like "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid Material</link> used for space buildings."
msgstr ""

