msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SWEEPBOTSTATION.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Deploys an automated <link=\"SWEEPBOT\">Sweepy Bot</link> to sweep up <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> debris and <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> spills.\n"
"\n"
